-- Creature melee damage comes from creature_classlevelstats.damage_<expansion> since 2026_09_06_00_world.sql, but
-- the table only had numbers where the old MoP data did: damage_exp1 was 0 for levels 1-56 and 74-83, damage_exp2
-- for 1-66, damage_exp3 for 1-79, and every column but damage_exp4 above 85. Creatures at those levels hit for
-- next to nothing (Hour of Twilight and Dragon Soul elites, Raging Fire Elementals, Northrend's Deranged Explorers).

-- 1. damage_exp1 and damage_exp2: the values of TrinityCore's 3.3.5 data (as kept by AzerothCore), which match
--    ours within a few percent at the levels both have
